{title: Meri Duniya Me Aake}
{artist: Tum Bin Sonu Nigam Chithra}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm]Meri duniya [G]mein aake
[A]mat jaa [Em]Mat jaa,
[A]kahin [Bm]mat jaa
[G]Meri duniya [A]mein aake
[Bm]mat jaa, [Bm]mat jaa, [Bm]mat jaa
[Bm]Kya maine paa liya hai
[G]Kya maine [Bm]kho diya hai
[Bm]Shaayad yeh sochkar hi
[G]Dil aaj [Bm]ro diya hai
[Bm]Tu hi to [G]tha mera apna
[Bm]Kaise phir [G]yeh toota sapna
[Bm]Tu jo [G]milke kho jaayega
[Bm]Jeena mushkil [G]ho jaayega
[Bm]OO..Meri duniya [G]mein aake...
[Bm]Yeh ishq ki hain raahein
[G]Main jinpe [Bm]chal raha hoon
[Bm]Is aag mein na jaane
[G]Kab se main [Bm]jal raha hoon
[Bm]Main to [G]hoon tera deewana
[Bm]Tune mujhko [G]na pehchaana
[Bm]Dilbar mere [G]aisa na kar
[Bm]Chaahat mein tu [G]ruswaa na kar
[Bm]OOO.. Meri [G]duniya mein aake
